l,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104108","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104108.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104108.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"~Depends on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104107.~\r\n\r\nThis PR changes behavior somewhat when converting modifier keys to string: It will omit the final `+`.\r\nFor example: `keycode_get_string(Key::CTRL)` will now print `Ctrl` instead of `Ctrl+`.\r\n\r\nIn addition, it will now error out when trying to convert `0` (aka `Key::NONE`) because it is not a valid keycode.\r\n\r\n## Note\r\nI'm not 100% sure this change is wanted; it might be desirable behavior for modifier keys to be clearly marked as such by the trailing `+`. But at the same time, it might be confusing if something is _actually_ triggered by just a 'modifier key'. That's why I opened the PR.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104108/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104108/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}